    "problem": "Write a JavaScript function called `chunk(arr, size)` that splits an array into chunks of the given size. The last chunk may be smaller. Requirements: (1) throw Error('invalid size') if size is less than 1 or not an integer, (2) empty array returns [], (3) does not mutate the original array. Return only the function, no explanation.",
